# 5.6.19-m4-kbdled with 0037 + 0038 only (no 0039), trixie card, 2026-10-24.
# Warm reboot after a suspend that lost an unplug: the TS3A227E kept the event
# pending, so INTB (mic-int) is low from boot. Two plug/unplug cycles: the chip
# follows (acc), the expander interrupts, the TS3A227E handler never runs (ts_irq 0)
# and the card stays off.
